@prefix ex: <https://example.test/clean#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
ex:S a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:SubThing ;
    sh:property ex:PS .
ex:PS a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path ex:hasName ; sh:datatype xsd:integer ; sh:minCount 1 .
